{"id": "3210347", "revid": "542997", "url": "https://ro.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=3210347", "title": "Lista celor mai \u00eenalte poduri din lume \u00een func\u021bie de \u00een\u0103l\u021bimea platformei", "text": "Lista celor mai \u00eenalte poduri din lume \u00een func\u021bie de \u00een\u0103l\u021bimea platformei clasific\u0103 cele mai \u00eenalte poduri \u00een func\u021bie de distan\u021ba \u00eentre platforma podului (tablier) \u0219i fundul v\u0103ii sau suprafa\u021ba apei de sub pod. Au fost luate \u00een considerare doar podurile cu o \u00een\u0103l\u021bime a platformei de cel pu\u021bin . \nProvincia chinez\u0103 Guizhou g\u0103zduie\u0219te aproape jum\u0103tate dintre cele mai \u00eenalte din lume din punct de vedere al \u00een\u0103l\u021bimii platformei, dou\u0103 dintre acestea, Huajiang Grand Canyon \u0219i Duge, ambele peste r\u00e2ul Beipan, fiind \u00een 2025 cele mai \u00eenalte poduri din lume, av\u00e2nd o \u00een\u0103l\u021bime fa\u021b\u0103 de r\u00e2u de 625, respectiv , echivalent cu \u00een\u0103l\u021bimea unor cl\u0103diri de peste ."}
